Package: groundtruth
Title: Simulation Studies for Gaussian and Logistic Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Shinichi", "Nakagawa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "snakagaw@ualberta.ca")
Description: Generate independent Gaussian or Bernoulli-logit data, compare fitting
    adapters on paired observations, retain every fit attempt, replay recorded random
    streams, and export data with provenance. Summaries report coefficient recovery,
    Monte Carlo uncertainty, and interval coverage with explicit failure denominators.
    Logistic comparisons are bounded to fixed-effect intercept and slope targets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, digest
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2, pkgdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://itchyshin.github.io/groundtruth/, https://github.com/itchyshin/groundtruth
BugReports: https://github.com/itchyshin/groundtruth/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
